# 5. UI/UX and Design Standards

- Use Tailwind CSS throughout the application.
- Maintain a modern, elegant, professional SaaS design.
- Use a consistent professional font family.
- Define centralized color palettes and design tokens.
- Support light and dark themes.
- Maintain consistent layouts, spacing, typography, shadows, borders, and corner radiuses.
