# 29. FINAL EXECUTION RULE

The application must be developed in the exact phase order defined above unless the user explicitly approves a change.

The AI coding assistant must work only on the current approved phase.

The user controls the development progression.

**One phase → Implementation → Automated Testing → Manual User Testing → Bug Fixing → User Approval → Next Phase.**

Never sacrifice quality for development speed.

The ultimate objective is not simply to finish the application quickly. It is to build a reliable, secure, maintainable, financially accurate, scalable SaaS product with every phase independently verified.